/T (Now we know that structure is fractal and moves in a zigzag, and every zigzag has a little  structure within it, now once the higher timeframe structure intentions have been completed,  the lower timeframe structure will become liquidity and the swing highs or low of the internal  structures have buy-stops and sell stops resting above them. And the algorithm will target the  internal structure swing highs and in the same process test the premium \(bearish\) or discount  \(bullish\) of the newly formed range. )
